  "category": "retro-glitch",
  "url": "shaders/holographic-glitch.wgsl",
  "description": "Peeled, sheared hologram with grating-order ghosts, a peel shadow, and emitter blackouts. The scan carrier drops out on its nulls, and the grating beats the scan into a moiré.",
